  "details": "Right now if a user is in a station, they can't interact with portals at all. This means that in worlds that rely on station-based player movement, we have to figure out ways to notify players that portals don't work, and also manually design areas where they can place portals. Making it so that portals work when in stations would solve these problems and prevent confusion in worlds that implement station based locomotion.",
